/// Compresses an N-point FFT trace (e.g. 4096 points) into 2 * targetPixels
/// points by finding the minimum and maximum dBm value within each pixel column bucket.
/// Preserves narrow spectral peaks and deep notches 100% reliably.
class TraceDecimator {
